---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---
<BaseLayout
  title="About — Yyogaa"
  description="Learn about Yyogaa — a modern space for yoga, breathwork, meditation, sound and mindful living."
>

<main>

  <section class="about-hero">

    <div class="page-width about-hero-grid">

      <div>

        <p class="section-kicker">ABOUT YYOGAA</p>

        <h1>
          A simpler way
          to <span>practice.</span>
        </h1>

        <p>
          Yyogaa is a modern space for movement, breath,
          meditation, sound and mindful living.
        </p>

        <a href="/yoga" class="button button-gold">
          Explore Yoga
        </a>

      </div>

      <div class="about-hero-image">

        <img
          src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1545389336-cf090694435e?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1400&q=85"
          alt="Yoga practice"
        >

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="section about-story">

    <div class="page-width about-story-grid">

      <div>

        <p class="section-kicker">THE IDEA</p>

        <h2>
          Start where you are.
        </h2>

      </div>

      <div>

        <p>
          Yyogaa was created around a simple idea:
          wellness should feel approachable, not intimidating.
        </p>

        <p>
          You do not need to already be flexible, calm or experienced.
          You can begin with one pose, one breath or one quiet moment.
        </p>

        <p>
          The goal is not perfection. The goal is building
          a practice that supports your everyday life.
        </p>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="section about-values">

    <div class="page-width">

      <div class="center-heading">
        <p class="section-kicker">WHAT GUIDES YYOGAA</p>
        <h2>Simple principles.</h2>
      </div>


      <div class="principles-grid">

        <div>
          <span>01</span>
          <h3>Accessibility</h3>
          <p>
            Practice should feel possible for beginners
            as well as experienced students.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span>02</span>
          <h3>Awareness</h3>
          <p>
            Learn to pay attention to your body,
            breath and inner state.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span>03</span>
          <h3>Consistency</h3>
          <p>
            Small practices repeated regularly can become
            part of everyday life.
          </p>
        </div>

        <div>
          <span>04</span>
          <h3>Curiosity</h3>
          <p>
            Explore movement, breath, meditation and sound
            without needing one perfect path.
          </p>
        </div>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="section about-pillars">

    <div class="page-width">

      <div class="center-heading">
        <p class="section-kicker">THE PRACTICE</p>
        <h2>Four ways to return.</h2>
      </div>


      <div class="foundation-grid">

        <article class="foundation-card">

          <a href="/yoga">

            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1575052814086-f385e2e2ad1b?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85"
              alt="Yoga"
            >

            <div>
              <span>01</span>
              <h3>Yoga</h3>
              <p>Move with intention →</p>
            </div>

          </a>

        </article>


        <article class="foundation-card">

          <a href="/breathwork">

            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1506126613408-eca07ce68773?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85"
              alt="Breathwork"
            >

            <div>
              <span>02</span>
              <h3>Breath</h3>
              <p>Breathe with awareness →</p>
            </div>

          </a>

        </article>


        <article class="foundation-card">

          <a href="/meditation">

            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1510894347712-4b17eeec7868?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85"
              alt="Meditation"
            >

            <div>
              <span>03</span>
              <h3>Meditation</h3>
              <p>Return to stillness →</p>
            </div>

          </a>

        </article>


        <article class="foundation-card">

          <a href="/sound">

            <img
              src="https://images.unsplash.com/photo-1529693662653-9d480530a697?auto=format&fit=crop&w=1000&q=85"
              alt="Sound"
            >

            <div>
              <span>04</span>
              <h3>Sound</h3>
              <p>Listen deeply →</p>
            </div>

          </a>

        </article>

      </div>

    </div>

  </section>


  <section class="final-cta">

    <div>

      <p class="section-kicker">YYOGAA</p>

      <h2>
        Your practice.
        Your pace.
      </h2>

      <p>
        Start where you are and let the practice evolve with you.
      </p>

      <a href="/contact" class="button button-gold">
        Connect With Yyogaa
      </a>

    </div>

  </section>

</main>

</BaseLayout>
